
"NewPlayer_City_01_01.txt" "<face heading><span align=center>Welcome to Atlas Park!</span></face><br>All heroes should talk to Matthew Habashy to get their first mission.  He is standing in front of the steps of City Hall.  <br><br>As you level up or would like to make adjustments to your costume, see Ms. Liberty in front of the Atlas Statue.  Tailors can also be found at Icon."
"NewPlayer_City_01_03.txt" "<face heading><span align=center>Welcome to Galaxy City!</span></face><br> If you are just arriving from the Tutorial, you should visit the Back Alley Brawler to train yourself. All heroes will want to stop in Freedom Corps Headquarters to meet their first contact."
"NewPlayer_V_City_01_01.txt" "<face heading><span align=center>You have arrived in Mercy Isle.</span></face><br>All villains should report to Operative Kuzmin for their first mission.<br><br>As you level up or would like to make adjustments to your costume, see Arbiter Richard.  Tailors can also be found at Facemakers."
